
# Deploy Guide

## Local
```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python cyber_lens_pipeline.py
streamlit run app/streamlit_app.py
```

## GitHub
Push: README.md, requirements.txt, streamlit_app.py, cyber_lens_pipeline.py, docs/Cyber_Lens_Report.pdf, figures/, data/

## Streamlit Cloud
- New app → connect repo → entry file: app/streamlit_app.py → deploy.
